summary:
  The helper's answer sends a saved station to the relay although the
  listener stopped it while the question was out.

history:
  The question about a stream goes out beside the start and comes back up
  to three seconds later. A stop in between takes the standing order down
  and disarms the relay, and an answer that armed it again would bring the
  tap up and play a station the listener had just silenced. The answer may
  move only the order that asked: stop, park, another station, a night.

target:
  package/contents/ui/StreamKind.qml

find:
          if (_audition !== "" ? app._previewUrl !== _audition : (app._previewUrl !== "" || app._wantsPlaying !== true)) return false;

replace:
          if (_audition !== "" ? app._previewUrl !== _audition : (app._previewUrl !== "")) return false;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_streamkind.qml::test_an_answer_for_an_order_that_ended_moves_nothing.
  Line-neutral.
